WEBVTT

00:02.840 --> 00:04.510
<i>Racing should be fun.</i>

00:04.710 --> 00:06.720
<i>On Oban, it's a different story.</i>

00:07.260 --> 00:09.510
<i>Everyone's after
the Ultimate Prize.</i>

00:09.930 --> 00:12.470
<i>Prince Aikka,
my former best friend,</i>

00:12.720 --> 00:14.890
<i>attacked us
for a handful of points.</i>

00:15.350 --> 00:17.020
<i>My father is so
obsessed with the</i> race

00:17.180 --> 00:20.190
<i>that he can't figure out
that I'm his long-lost daughter, Eva.</i>

00:20.690 --> 00:21.810
<i>Hello, I'm here.</i>

00:23.270 --> 00:24.480
Whatever.

00:24.980 --> 00:25.730
<i>Me?</i>

00:25.900 --> 00:28.950
<i>Well, I have my own reasons
for wanting to win.</i>

00:29.150 --> 00:30.700
<i>It's kind of personal.</i>

02:26.810 --> 02:27.980
What do you want from me?

02:34.450 --> 02:35.950
<i>Aikka...</i>

02:36.820 --> 02:39.030
Molly, I needed to speak
to you, face to face.

02:43.080 --> 02:45.420
Though you probably
won't believe this,

02:45.750 --> 02:48.460
I deeply regret my surprise attack
in the Ice Region.

02:49.000 --> 02:51.630
Did you drag me out here
just to tell me that?

02:52.090 --> 02:54.420
I thought Nourasians
prided themselves on honor.

02:54.970 --> 02:57.640
That was not
the purpose of my visit.

02:59.050 --> 03:00.180
Prince, what are you...

03:00.970 --> 03:02.850
I came to tell you this.

03:03.020 --> 03:06.270
Stay away from me,
for your own protection.

03:06.440 --> 03:09.110
The race is nearly over
and my options are few.

03:09.270 --> 03:10.690
<i>Aikka...</i>

03:11.270 --> 03:13.780
Forget we were
ever friends, Molly.

03:13.940 --> 03:15.860
The race is not compatible
with friendship.

03:17.570 --> 03:18.780
Molly?

03:18.950 --> 03:20.330
What are you doing down here?

04:02.580 --> 04:04.700
Hey, are you OK, Molly?

04:05.250 --> 04:07.960
Or did your sleepwalking
shake you up?

04:08.120 --> 04:10.380
I'm a little tired, that's all.

04:10.630 --> 04:13.340
Come on, Jordan. Let's go.

04:24.220 --> 04:28.560
Thank you all for coming
to our little mid-competition party.

04:30.480 --> 04:32.650
Come closer, come closer.
Don't be shy!

04:33.650 --> 04:37.780
One, two, three, and four,
five, six, seven, and eight,

04:37.940 --> 04:40.740
and, <i>uh...</i> what's happened
to the ninth team?

04:47.040 --> 04:48.710
Perfect. You're all here now.

04:51.170 --> 04:55.630
Everyone, please welcome
my master, the Avatar!

05:27.330 --> 05:29.370
Proud pilots!

05:30.580 --> 05:33.630
Congratulations
on your first five races

05:33.790 --> 05:36.000
of the Grand Finals.

05:37.460 --> 05:41.010
Special praise is due
to the current leader,

05:41.170 --> 05:43.680
Sul of Gumaria.

05:45.970 --> 05:47.260
Well, look at that, if it isn't

05:47.430 --> 05:50.270
Prince Poodle
and his new pal, Kross.

05:51.640 --> 05:52.480
Oh, yeah.

05:52.640 --> 05:55.230
Looks like they make
a perfect couple, don't they?

05:57.070 --> 06:01.240
You all deserve praise
for your sacrifices thus far.

06:01.900 --> 06:06.120
But the Time
of Final Revelations approaches.

06:07.160 --> 06:10.870
Four races remain
across the wild landscape

06:11.040 --> 06:13.460
of the Mother Planet, Oban.

06:13.620 --> 06:15.920
This is your last chance

06:16.080 --> 06:20.920
to prove yourselves
worthy of the Ultimate Prize.

06:21.260 --> 06:22.920
Prepare,

06:23.090 --> 06:28.310
or forever mourn your lack
of strength and resolve.

06:30.020 --> 06:34.060
Believe me, I won't let anything
stand in my way now.

06:37.980 --> 06:43.530
Remember, our salvation
or our downfall depends on it.

07:02.170 --> 07:06.130
The great deceiver has spoken.

07:06.340 --> 07:11.310
You are all fooled,
like I was then.

07:20.610 --> 07:24.780
Soon the brilliant light
of clarity will shine.

07:43.880 --> 07:47.880
Enjoy first place, Sul,
while you can.

07:48.840 --> 07:51.600
The Ultimate Prize is destined
for the Kross!

08:00.860 --> 08:01.730
Let's split.

08:01.900 --> 08:03.860
It's getting kind of hot
around here.

08:10.370 --> 08:11.780
What's with these giant craters?

08:11.950 --> 08:13.160
More acid pools?

08:13.330 --> 08:14.490
Hard to tell.

08:15.040 --> 08:16.450
They're too deep
for our scanners.

08:38.480 --> 08:40.150
<i>What kind of treacherous trap</i>

08:40.310 --> 08:41.560
<i>are we being lured into now?</i>

08:51.320 --> 08:52.820
Here goes nothing.

09:20.230 --> 09:23.060
I give up.
Anyone see anything?

09:30.360 --> 09:31.820
Molly, there's something below.

09:33.280 --> 09:34.370
Watch out!

09:52.340 --> 09:53.760
Where are we?
What is this place?

10:10.070 --> 10:11.440
This isn't a school trip, Molly.

10:12.030 --> 10:13.400
Koji's found the gate.

10:13.570 --> 10:15.070
There's only one. Move it!

10:15.240 --> 10:16.240
Yes, sir.

10:38.050 --> 10:39.680
What is going on here?

10:39.970 --> 10:42.640
I thought there were no advanced
civilizations on this planet.

10:43.560 --> 10:45.350
None of these tunnels
were built, sir.

10:45.520 --> 10:47.190
They appear to be natural.

10:47.650 --> 10:50.730
It's a fantastic source
of pure organic energy.

10:50.940 --> 10:52.940
It's the womb of Oban.

10:53.110 --> 10:54.740
I find that unlikely.

10:54.900 --> 10:56.700
Just give me something
I can work with, Koji.

11:11.920 --> 11:13.760
I'll take care of Sul.

11:13.920 --> 11:16.050
You, Prince,
take care of the others.

11:32.860 --> 11:35.990
<i>Unsakai', doubla nourama katar!</i>

11:57.880 --> 11:59.390
<i>UnsakaT, nourama terra!</i>

12:04.310 --> 12:05.560
Jordan, don't shoot!

12:05.730 --> 12:08.520
Have you lost your mind?
He's the puppet of the Crogs!

12:08.690 --> 12:09.850
He'll take us down again!

12:12.610 --> 12:14.940
Would you rather we shot
each other down instead?

12:22.200 --> 12:25.450
<i>I'm sure deep down,
the Prince hasn't really changed.</i>

12:39.970 --> 12:44.180
<i>Prince Aikka, my son,
the Grog forces have...</i>

12:45.600 --> 12:48.600
<i>GONG 1.0 OUT TGSCUQ and...</i>

12:48.770 --> 12:50.900
landed in the Holy City of Dol.

12:51.850 --> 12:52.770
No!

12:53.060 --> 12:54.320
It is my will

12:54.480 --> 12:57.900
that you now serve them
as you would your king.

12:58.400 --> 13:00.150
Worry not for our safety,
my lovely prince.

13:00.320 --> 13:01.990
Remain faithful to your code.

13:10.080 --> 13:11.420
<i>I warned you, Molly.</i>

13:11.580 --> 13:12.920
<i>What more can I do?</i>

13:14.090 --> 13:14.670
No!

13:36.480 --> 13:38.740
-Sir, I got the info you wanted.
-Yes, and?

13:39.400 --> 13:42.740
These spheres of energy,
their density is breathtaking.

13:42.910 --> 13:44.820
That's why the computers
were going crazy.

13:45.410 --> 13:46.780
What do you mean?

13:46.950 --> 13:48.790
There's enough matter
in each of these spheres

13:48.950 --> 13:50.040
to produce a small planet.

13:50.660 --> 13:54.500
A small planet? Are you sure?
What would happen if one bursts?

13:57.460 --> 13:59.170
It's best not to even
consider it, sir.

14:12.390 --> 14:14.190
So the ancient legends are true.

14:17.860 --> 14:19.360
Meditate on this.

14:51.310 --> 14:53.640
I can't believe this.
It's amazing!

15:30.510 --> 15:32.140
Eva!

15:36.640 --> 15:38.900
All communications
are down, sir.

15:39.110 --> 15:40.520
Even the Stone Gate is gone.

15:48.280 --> 15:49.820
Control room, do you read me?

15:50.620 --> 15:51.450
This is Molly.

15:55.120 --> 15:56.210
We're OK.

15:56.370 --> 15:58.620
I think the Avatar just wanted
to scare us a little.

15:58.790 --> 16:00.420
And he did a beautiful job of it.

16:14.100 --> 16:14.930
We're on our way back.

16:33.080 --> 16:35.450
Today's event
should never have been.

16:36.250 --> 16:39.000
My vision of the future
has been obscured.

16:39.170 --> 16:42.750
The wheels of destiny
have been altered.

17:06.030 --> 17:07.400
Did you find out what that was?

17:09.070 --> 17:10.740
I doubt we'll ever know.

17:10.910 --> 17:14.410
All I can say is Oban is
a very special planet.

17:14.620 --> 17:16.790
It's a living planet.

17:17.620 --> 17:21.500
Somehow it sends matter
into outer space, very dense matter.

17:24.420 --> 17:25.880
Could it be seeds?

17:26.090 --> 17:28.590
Seeds? You mean,
like planet seeds?

17:30.260 --> 17:33.390
That sounds like
an interesting idea, but unlikely.

17:33.550 --> 17:36.720
We know that planets were
created during the Big Bang,

17:36.890 --> 17:38.430
around 20 billion years ago.

17:39.350 --> 17:42.940
Didn't the Avatar call Oban
the Mother Planet this morning?

17:43.100 --> 17:44.440
Yes, he did.

17:45.940 --> 17:48.650
Let's stick to the official theories,
if you don't mind.

17:48.900 --> 17:50.280
Enough theories, Koji.

17:50.440 --> 17:52.860
-Let's leave these two alone now.
-OK.

17:53.490 --> 17:55.320
-Come on.
-Yeah, they deserve it.

17:56.410 --> 17:58.240
We don't want
to intrude on anything.

17:59.200 --> 18:01.250
-Good night.
-Be good now!

18:27.900 --> 18:30.440
These stars are
amazingly beautiful,

18:31.440 --> 18:33.740
but they can't hold
a candle to you.

18:39.450 --> 18:42.370
How about you stargaze alone?
I'm freezing.

18:43.160 --> 18:44.870
Good night, partner.

19:39.220 --> 19:41.640
Molly? Uh...
You're not asleep yet?

19:43.600 --> 19:45.980
Do you mind if we talk a little?

19:50.190 --> 19:53.320
I've wanted to tell you this
for a long time, but...

19:53.480 --> 19:55.900
something always seems
to get in the way.

19:56.740 --> 19:58.030
<i>We“...</i>

19:58.280 --> 20:00.320
the thing is,
I really care about you, Molly.

20:00.490 --> 20:03.040
More than a partner,
more than a friend.

20:06.460 --> 20:08.830
But, well, of course,
if you don't feel the same way,

20:09.000 --> 20:10.840
I'd totally understand.

20:17.470 --> 20:19.220
You don't have to say anything.

20:19.390 --> 20:22.390
I'll just leave these flowers here
and wait outside.

20:22.560 --> 20:26.640
If you walk out with them,
I'll know you feel the same way.

20:45.620 --> 20:49.000
Thanks a lot for the flowers,
Jordan. They're beautiful.

20:49.830 --> 20:51.290
Good night, my boy.

20:58.220 --> 20:59.260
Molly?

21:15.320 --> 21:17.990
Prince Aikka, answer me!

21:18.570 --> 21:20.240
Why did you change?

21:20.450 --> 21:23.160
Why should the race
change any of us?
